- Okta conditional access profiles for macOS and Windows now use a one-time challenge per host (`$FLEET_VAR_CONDITIONAL_ACCESS_SCEP_CHALLENGE`) instead of a global enroll secret, which is no longer needed to get the profiles. To switch, copy and redeploy them from **Settings > Integrations > Conditional access**.
- Profiles already deployed with a global enroll secret keep working, except on hosts whose platform has `mdm.apple_one_time_enroll_secrets` or `mdm.windows_one_time_enroll_secrets` turned on: Fleet now refuses the global enroll secret for those hosts, as it does for fleetd enrollment.
